WEBVTT

00:24:58.610 --> 00:25:01.076
of electronic health records.

00:25:01.100 --> 00:25:04.686
AB: There's, like, 30 tabs
on the left-hand side,

00:25:04.710 --> 00:25:09.132
and if you click on one of them,
it opens up into another 20-tab menu.

00:25:09.156 --> 00:25:10.213
(Adam laughs)

00:25:10.237 --> 00:25:11.673
AB: I mean, it makes no sense.

00:25:11.697 --> 00:25:13.934
AG: Oh, the joys of electronic
health records.

00:25:13.958 --> 00:25:15.239
AB: It makes no sense.

00:25:15.263 --> 00:25:21.486
So actually, we created task forces
around better managing all the boxes

00:25:21.510 --> 00:25:24.284
and minimized even the number
of categories or clicks

00:25:24.308 --> 00:25:28.066
that someone could even have
in the electronic health record,

00:25:28.090 --> 00:25:30.183
as a means to make their life simpler.